, 2016. The State Flag consists of a white rectangle with a ratio of four to seven between the height and width; in the center it bears the State Coat of arms.","story_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flag_of_Quintana_Roo","img":"img/q80245.webp","src":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Flag_of_Quintana_Roo.svg?width=960","credit":{"artist":"Heraldry","license":"Public domain","url":null,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Quintana_Roo.svg"},"ready":true},{"id":"q79918","q":"Q79918","name":"Durango","region":"Mexico","kind":"mxstate","lat":24.9347,"lon":-104.9119,"pop":1754754,"about":"State of Mexico","wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Durango","story":"The Flag of Durango is the flag used by the Mexican state of Durango. The flag was adopted on March 9, 2014.","story_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flag_of_Durango","img":"img/q79918.webp","src":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Flag_of_Durango.svg?width=960","credit":{"artist":"Heraldry","license":"Public domain","url":null,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Durango.svg"},"ready":true},{"id":"q82681","q":"Q82681","name":"Tlaxcala","region":"Mexico","kind":"mxstate","lat":19.4,"lon":-98.1,"pop":1272847,"about":"State of Mexico","wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tlaxcala","story":"The flag of Tlaxcala was adopted in 2016. It is colored red and white and bears the State Emblem in the center. The emblem consists of a rectangle ratio of width-length 3:2, divided by a diagonal line from the bottom right (hoist-side) to the downer left.","story_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flag_of_Tlaxcala","img":"img/q82681.webp","src":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Flag_of_Tlaxcala.svg?width=960","credit":{"artist":"Javitomad","license":"Public domain","url":null,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Tlaxcala.svg"},"ready":true},{"id":"q61309","q":"Q61309","name":"Colima","region":"Mexico","kind":"m